      "text": "离别虽然在眼前说再见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 205380,
      "end_ms": 206720,
      "text": "唱不上去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 206959,
      "end_ms": 210390,
      "text": "再见不会太遥远"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 210390,
      "end_ms": 212070,
      "text": "唱离别无聊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 212070,
      "end_ms": 213090,
      "text": "唱唱不上去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 213090,
      "end_ms": 213930,
      "text": "不好意思啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 213930,
      "end_ms": 216730,
      "text": "离别虽然在眼前"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 216730,
      "end_ms": 220380,
      "text": "哇啊就这样应付应付了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 221640,
      "end_ms": 223070,
      "text": "再唱最后一句"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 223070,
      "end_ms": 232280,
      "text": "若有缘有缘就能期待明天你和我重逢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
